{{Term/Store|Swim Dash Stamina Up||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Set Bonus]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
Swim Dash Stamina Up is a [[Set Bonus]] that decreases the [[Stamina]] used when dashing or using a spin attack while [[Swimming]] by 75%.

==={{BotW|-}}===
In {{BotW}}, Swim Dash Stamina Up is available on the [[Zora Set]] (★★) and the [[Salvager Armor Set]]. It is also available as a hidden [[Set Bonus]] on the [[Royal Guard Set]].

==={{TotK|-}}===
Swim Dash Stamina Up is only available as the [[Set Bonus]] for the [[Zora Set]] (★★) in {{TotK}}.

